# Forces a local-storage build for the browser tests.
#
# Vite gives a mode-specific env file higher priority than `.env.local`, so
# these blanks win and `isSupabaseConfigured` comes out false. The e2e scripts
# exist to prove the app's own logic — that a rating typed into the UI reaches
# the leaderboard intact, that a photo survives the round trip through storage.
# Pointing them at the real project would instead test the network, and would
# fail on every write, because they run as an anonymous visitor who by design
# cannot write.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
